{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2001年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主信息，2001年为辛巳年，命主时年8岁，处于乙卯大运（0-9岁，七杀运）。流年辛巳，天干辛金为食神，地支巳火为正印。原局日主己土生于辰月，得月令，时支子水为偏财，年柱癸酉为偏财食神，月柱丙辰为正印劫财，时柱丙子为正印偏财。整体土旺，喜金水木。\n\n2001年辛巳年，流年天干辛金食神透出，食神主表达、才艺、口才，且辛金坐巳火（正印），食神配印，利于学业、文艺表现。大运乙卯七杀，七杀主压力、竞争，但流年食神制杀，能将压力转化为表现机会。地支巳火为印星，与原局辰土、未土相生，印星旺，主学习、文书、名誉。巳酉半合金局，增强食神力量，食神生财（原局子水），有得名得利之象。\n\n综合来看，此年学业或课外活动中应有突出表现，尤其与口才、表演相关。选项B“参与小话剧演讲比赛获奖”最符合食神制杀、食神配印的组合。其他选项涉及伤病、意外，与流年吉象不符。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "f813e88e5ba5296cb1b854ca7dbe5a13577cdc4843426707bf91d81c8bbd7e09", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_limited_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3944, "response_id": "75969b8c-869d-44f2-8e3b-37636e3ca312", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 439, "completion_tokens": 309, "total_tokens": 748, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 183}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
